    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Last Sip \u2013 Version 1.0 (Unreal Engine)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Sip</i> offers a <strong>short yet atmospheric single-player experience</strong> that blends <strong>exploration, light puzzles, and sci-fi horror elements</strong>. You wake up in a mysterious facility with no memory of how you got there. As you explore, you begin to uncover unsettling clues about a strange transformation and your forgotten past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s Included in Version 1.0:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Mechanics</strong>: Simple yet effective controls focused on exploration and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Discover hidden messages and details that gradually reveal the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sci-Fi Environment</strong>: Explore a handcrafted level with immersive sound and visual design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and Focused Experience</strong>: Ideal for players looking for a brief but memorable game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version is designed to provide a <strong>compact yet impactful</strong> experience, especially for fans of mystery, atmosphere, and minimal storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Plans:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in development. Based on community feedback, we plan to add:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New areas to explore</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual and audio enhancements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded story content and lore</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional puzzles and secrets</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>If you enjoy the concept of <i>The Last Sip</i>, please let us know in the reviews or comments.</strong> Community interest will directly influence how the game evolves and what new content gets added in future updates.</p>",
